@startuml
title UML - independently approved synthetic funding correction
hide methods
class CorrectionRequest <<Finance immutable intent>> {
 id / executionId : original UUID
 originalBatchId : exact source
 actor / client / key : durable scope
 frozenSource / detailsDigest : immutable
 reason : 4..240 characters
 makerPerson : canonical UUID
 expiresAt : UTC + 24 hours
 registeredAt : one-time UTC?
}
class CorrectionDetails <<purpose bound>> {
 kind : FULL_SYNTHETIC_FUNDING_REVERSAL_V1
 sourceDigest / sourceFingerprint : original hashes
 sourceOperationId / sourceBusinessDate : native source
 currency : TST scale 2
 original / reversing legs : exact signed-i64 strings
 executionId / reason : immutable command
}
class Approval <<Controls FINANCE_CORRECTION>> {
 resource : original journal UUID
 digest : whole CorrectionDetails
 maker / checker : distinct canonical people
 current grants / queues / expiry : checked after locks
}
class JournalBatch <<Core immutable>> {
 id / operationId : native UUID
 postingKind : native type
 originalBatchId : linked source?
 entries : balanced exact legs
}
class CorrectionReceipt <<Core immutable proof>> {
 executionId / approvalId : unique
 originalBatchId : unique across corrections
 batchId : unique linked CORRECTION journal
 detailsDigest / people : exact accepted scope
 recordedAt : native UTC wall clock
}
class ExecutionObservation <<Finance immutable>> {
 requestId / actor : original scope
 reason : requested / receipt observed / not observed / inquiry unavailable
 createdAt : UTC
}
class CorrectionCommands <<narrow Core capability>>
class GLExport <<existing independent delivery>>
CorrectionRequest "1" *-- "1" CorrectionDetails
CorrectionRequest "1" --> "1" JournalBatch : frozen SYNTHETIC_FUNDING source
CorrectionRequest "1" --> "0..1" Approval
CorrectionRequest "1" --> "0..1" CorrectionReceipt : original execution receipt inquiry
CorrectionRequest "1" -- "0..*" ExecutionObservation
CorrectionReceipt --> JournalBatch : new CORRECTION with originalBatchId
CorrectionCommands --> CorrectionReceipt : atomic guarded financial posting
JournalBatch --> GLExport : existing sealed export / original lineage
note bottom of CorrectionCommands
Eligible source: one positive CUSTOMER leg and
one negative SETTLEMENT leg from SYNTHETIC_FUNDING.
Source + ordered account locks precede live authority checks.
Held funds and account restrictions remain enforced.
No payment, incoming/return, periodic fee or accrual reversal.
end note
@enduml
